  "document": "Manon Lescaut (1914 film)\nManon Lescaut is a 1914 American silent drama film directed by Herbert Hall Winslow and starring Lina Cavalieri, Lucien Muratore and Dorothy Arthur. It is an adaptation of the Abbé Prévost's novel \"Manon Lescaut\" (1731). It is now considered a lost film."
